#
# Build context for the Jofi image (Dockerfile): only sources of backend and frontend.
*
!backend/
!frontend/

# Local build output, caches and secrets never enter the image.
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
frontend/src/paraglide/
**/.env
**/.env.*
